                                "sense_id": "80730d0a-4992-30be-ad17-1ad8a92e1404",
                                "text": "Let any one compare the fruit of one of the largest varieties exhibited at our Shows with that of the wild wood strawberry, or, which will be a fairer comparison, with the somewhat larger fruit of the wild American Virginian Strawberry, and he will see what prodigies horticulture has effected."
